I took about six months off of Nethack, but just like always the bug always
returns.  I decided to renew my quest to ascend every character type.  So
check off Archeologist, Monk, Priest, Tourist, Valkryie, Wizard, and now
Knight.

Knight seems about equivalent to Archeologist, good fighter and spellcaster.
All around a very strong character, but with some annoying alignment
factors.  Near the end I just ended up killing things that were fleeing or
running anyway, and noted that Lugh still accepted my offer even though he
was unhappy with me.  Never used the knight jump move or rode my horse at
all.

I never really came close to blowing this once, except when I stepped into
the water before putting back on my ring of lev.  Also notable I found no
scrolls of genocide, not even one.  My self-imposed restrictions are no
genocide or conflict but I thought it was odd.

Found no wishes besides the ones in the castle.  Used 1 on a silver dragon
scale mail and the rest on magic markers.  Used the final wish on scrolls of
gold detection since I found only 1 of those the whole game, and I'm too
lazy to traverse the entire fire elemental level.  Turned out the portal was
as far away as possible too.  Found Grimtooth, Cleaver and Giantslayer just
laying around.

I had an idea for a new feature too.  Put the Nazgul king on the Astral
plane to fight.  He'd have to be extremely tough.  Make the rings of the
other 11(?) Nazgul each unique.  If you collect them all and destroy them on
the elemental plane of fire (in the lava), when you fight the Nazgul king
he's weakened.  Otherwise he can summon the other X, X being the number of
rings you didn't destroy.  Or something like that.  I suppose the game is
hard enough without all this though.

